        <fullName>TotalTime_Cost__c</fullName>
        <defaultValue>0</defaultValue>
        <inlineHelpText>Internal costs. Recorded timesheet hours (all users, task categories and tasks recorded on the project) against a standard hourly cost. Hourly costs are set in the SF user-profile of each user.</inlineHelpText>
        <label>Time Cost</label>
