        <fullName>Total_Expenses__c</fullName>
        <description>Chargeable and non-chargeable expenses recorded on the project. This includes expenses recorded in the “expense” and  “associate and other cost” section.</description>
        <formula>Expenses__c +   Associate_and_Other_Cost_Expenses__c</formula>
        <inlineHelpText>Chargeable and non-chargeable expenses recorded on the project. This includes expenses recorded in the “expense” and  “associate and other cost” section.</inlineHelpText>
